 ### Setapp Upload / Replacement Standard
 
+Before Setapp build/upload/config work, the shared Setapp lane guard requires each app repo to keep the Setapp lane explicit in `Setapp/README.md`, `.saneprocess`, `ARCHITECTURE.md`, `DEVELOPMENT.md`, and `.claude/research.md`. Refresh those docs/research first when the guard blocks.
+
