+  --release-notes-file /path/to/setapp-notes.txt \
+  --expected-version X.Y.Z \
+  --expected-build N
+
 ./scripts/SaneMaster.rb setapp_upload \
   --zip /path/to/App-Setapp-X.Y.Z.zip \
   --release-notes-file /path/to/setapp-notes.txt
 ```
 
+Archive shape:
+- The review ZIP must contain the `.app` bundle and a sibling PNG named `AppIcon.png`.
+- `AppIcon.png` must be at least 512x512px. Use a 1024x1024 export when available.
+- The `.app` bundle must include readable `CFBundleIdentifier`, `CFBundleShortVersionString`, and `CFBundleVersion` values.
+- App-specific sibling icons such as `SaneClip.png` can remain, but they do not replace Setapp's `AppIcon.png` requirement.
+
 Preferred path:
 - Use `SETAPP_AUTOMATION_TOKEN` with Setapp's documented `POST /v1/ci/version` endpoint.
 - Include `--allow-overwrite true` when replacing a build that is waiting for review.
